hell out of this rat.

788
00:29:09,210 --> 00:29:13,220
-[inaudible].

789
00:29:13,210 --> 00:29:14,710
-Wow, a lot of
blood in that rat.

790
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:19,720
-[inaudible]

791
