792
00:29:20,720 --> 00:29:22,230
Just cleaning up.
Groom, groom, groom.

793
00:29:22,220 --> 00:29:23,220
Gotta keep clean here.

794
00:29:23,220 --> 00:29:23,720
Hang on.

795
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:25,720
Heh.

796
00:29:25,730 --> 00:29:29,730
