807
00:29:53,250 --> 00:29:54,250
-Huh?

808
00:29:54,250 --> 00:29:56,250
---which caused death in
our early experiments.

809
00:29:56,260 --> 00:29:58,760
Please watch a target table.

810
00:29:58,760 --> 00:30:01,760
