811
00:30:05,770 --> 00:30:07,270
-Laser preheat.

812
00:30:07,270 --> 00:30:08,770
-Laser preheat.

813
00:30:08,770 --> 00:30:10,770
In.

814
00:30:10,770 --> 00:30:12,780
-Laser remission [inaudible].

815
00:30:12,770 --> 00:30:13,770
