-Cut the power!

824
00:30:40,300 --> 00:30:42,310
-Cut the power that be.

825
00:30:42,300 --> 00:30:45,800
-By mistake he cut the cheese.

826
00:30:45,810 --> 00:30:47,810
-Geez, India must
be so embarrassed

827
00:30:47,810 --> 00:30:49,310
