by these twits.

828
00:30:49,310 --> 00:30:53,320
-Yeah.

829
00:30:53,310 --> 00:30:55,310
-Got some clotted
cream in the car.

830
00:30:58,820 --> 00:31:01,820
-I wish this was "Cheech
and Chong's Up in Smoke."

831
00:31:01,820 --> 00:31:05,330
-Eh, all's I know is I hope
this movie has a good vent hood.

832
00:31:05,330 --> 00:31:08,330
