868
00:32:05,390 --> 00:32:06,390
-So we bought a truss.

869
00:32:06,390 --> 00:32:07,890
-I'm surprised we
weren't all killed.

870
00:32:07,890 --> 00:32:09,890
-I'm disappointed by it.

871
00:32:09,890 --> 00:32:11,890
-Who would want to
