including Blanchard.

897
00:32:57,440 --> 00:32:59,440
-Then the movie will
be off and running.

898
00:32:59,440 --> 00:33:00,440
-Right.

899
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:02,950
Well, I could always
do with a [inaudible].

900
00:33:02,940 --> 00:33:04,440
-Lembach is staying in
London for another few days.

901
00:33:04,440 --> 00:33:05,940
-Yay!
-Hooray!

902
00:33:05,950 --> 00:33:07,950
