him at Blanchard's house.

903
00:33:07,950 --> 00:33:09,950
-Well, then you'll be
able to convince him.

904
00:33:09,950 --> 00:33:12,960
-Yes, but someone seems to
be trying to prevent me.

905
00:33:12,950 --> 00:33:14,450
