906
00:33:14,450 --> 00:33:15,950
I'm sure we can get
it in order again.

907
00:33:15,960 --> 00:33:16,960
-Do you think so?

908
00:33:17,460 --> 00:33:17,960
-Yes, I do.

909
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:19,460
-Yes.

910
00:33:19,460 --> 00:33:21,460
-If I stand here talking,
