919
00:33:37,480 --> 00:33:38,480
-I thought he was
paid by the hour.

920
00:33:38,480 --> 00:33:40,980
-Oh, [inaudible].
-I've been watching both of you.

921
00:33:40,980 --> 00:33:41,980
-From the bushes.

922
00:33:41,980 --> 00:33:44,490
-Be very careful
before you go too far.

923
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:46,980
