that I'm ready.

929
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:58,000
-Why?
What do you have in mind?

930
00:33:58,000 --> 00:34:00,000
-An idea.

931
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:01,000
Nothing more.

932
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:02,510
-I've got to go spot
clean the monkey.

933
00:34:02,500 --> 00:34:10,170
-Backo.

934
00:34:10,180 --> 00:34:12,180
-But I have succeeded.

935
00:34:12,180 --> 00:34:15,180
-My dear Paul, this is
neither the time nor the place

936
00:34:15,180 --> 00:34:16,690
