excellent dinner.

940
00:34:21,190 --> 00:34:23,190
-I am not arguing.

941
00:34:23,190 --> 00:34:24,190
I am stating facts.

942
00:34:24,690 --> 00:34:26,700
I have only to call my two
assistants who are waiting.

943
00:34:26,690 --> 00:34:28,690
I can arrange a
demonstration tonight.

944
00:34:28,700 --> 00:34:29,700
Now!

945
00:34:29,700 --> 00:34:31,700
-Steiner, you are
behaving inexcusably.

946
00:34:31,700 --> 00:34:33,200
-And in front of Lembach.

947
00:34:33,200 --> 00:34:36,210
-You were only invited because
Professor Lembach wanted

948
00:34:36,200 --> 00:34:38,200
