958
00:34:56,720 --> 00:34:57,720
This is my evidence.

959
00:34:57,720 --> 00:34:59,220
-A solenoid?

960
00:34:59,230 --> 00:35:00,730
-It doesn't take
a technical mind

961
00:35:00,730 --> 00:35:02,730
