the ends of the connection.

962
00:35:02,730 --> 00:35:06,240
-If there had been sabotage,
Dr. Mitchell would have told me.

963
00:35:06,230 --> 00:35:09,230
-At my request, he did not.

964
00:35:09,740 --> 00:35:12,240
Come with me, and
see for yourself.

965
00:35:12,240 --> 00:35:13,740
-Steiner!

966
00:35:14,240 --> 00:35:16,250
-Made you look.

967
00:35:16,240 --> 00:35:17,740
-I had no intention of
telling you tonight,

968
00:35:17,740 --> 00:35:20,740
but now you are forcing me.

969
00:35:20,750 --> 00:35:22,250
Only this morning,
my committee decided

970
00:35:22,250 --> 00:35:24,250
they have gone far enough.

971
00:35:24,250 --> 00:35:27,260
Your experiment
will be abandoned.

972
00:35:27,250 --> 00:35:29,750
Tomorrow you will start
dismantling your laboratory

973
00:35:29,760 --> 00:35:33,260
to make room for another
and more urgent project.

974
00:35:33,260 --> 00:35:34,260
-A second bathroom.

975
00:35:34,260 --> 00:35:36,270
-I cannot accept your decision.

976
00:35:36,260 --> 00:35:37,260
It's monstrous.

977
00:35:37,260 --> 00:35:38,760
I've achieved success.

978
00:35:38,770 --> 00:35:40,770
You cannot deny me
my demonstration.

979
00:35:40,770 --> 00:35:41,770
-You have no choice.

980
00:35:42,270 --> 00:35:45,270
-Lembach, do something.

981
00:35:45,270 --> 00:35:49,280
-How long will you
gentlemen be here?

982
00:35:49,280 --> 00:35:50,280
-For some time.

983
00:35:50,280 --> 00:35:51,280
Why?

984
00:35:51,280 --> 00:35:53,280
-Then I will give
you evidence that

985
00:35:53,280 --> 00:35:56,290
will force you to
acclaim my discovery.

986
00:35:56,280 --> 00:35:57,280
-Funding intrigue.

987
00:35:57,280 --> 00:36:00,780
-I cannot allow my friend to
leave in this state of mind.

988
00:36:00,790 --> 00:36:02,290
-Professor?
-There's cake.

989
00:36:02,290 --> 00:36:04,790
-I think it would be
better to leave him alone.

990
00:36:04,790 --> 00:36:07,300
-Were you not hard on him, Dr.?

991
00:36:07,290 --> 00:36:09,790
It was not of my seeking.

992
00:36:09,800 --> 00:36:12,300
And in any case,
he had to be told.

993
00:36:12,300 --> 00:36:16,310
Under the circumstances, this
seemed as good a time as any.

994
00:36:16,300 --> 00:36:19,300
-What were his
prospects of success?

995
00:36:19,310 --> 00:36:21,810
-One in crap-dillion.

996
00:36:21,810 --> 00:36:25,820
-Like most other advanced
experiments, limited.

997
00:36:25,810 --> 00:36:29,310
[phone ringing]

998
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:30,820
Oh, the world is ending!

999
00:36:30,820 --> 00:36:32,320
-Oh, it's just a British phone.

1000
00:36:32,320 --> 00:36:33,320
Ok.

1001
00:36:33,320 --> 00:36:36,330
-Wow, that was close.

1002
00:36:36,320 --> 00:36:37,820
-Hello?

1003
00:36:37,820 --> 00:36:39,320
Oh, Dr. Hill.

1004
00:36:39,330 --> 00:36:40,830
No, he isn't back yet.

1005
00:36:40,830 --> 00:36:42,330
-Not back?

1006
00:36:42,330 --> 00:36:43,830
Have you heard from him?

1007
00:36:43,830 --> 00:36:45,330
-No.

1008
00:36:45,330 --> 00:36:46,340
It's getting very late.

1009
00:36:46,330 --> 00:36:50,330
I can't stay much longer,
or I'll miss my bus.

1010
00:36:50,340 --> 00:36:51,840
-Who is it?
-It's Dr. Hill.

1011
00:36:51,840 --> 00:36:53,840
-Eh, well, too bad.

1012
00:36:53,840 --> 00:36:55,340
-Sheila, I need your help.

1013
00:36:55,340 --> 00:36:56,350
-Of course, Professor.

1014
00:36:56,340 --> 00:36:59,840
-All right, come with me.
Leave it.

1015
00:36:59,850 --> 00:37:01,350
-But it will be Dr. Hill again.

1016
00:37:01,350 --> 00:37:02,350
-I said, leave it.

1017
00:37:02,350 --> 00:37:05,350
-We're going to the
Cliff Richards concert.

1018
00:37:05,350 --> 00:37:06,360
-Was it Hill again?

1019
00:37:06,850 --> 00:37:07,850
Will Lembach stay?

1020
00:37:07,850 --> 00:37:10,350
-I want to know why Sheila put
the telephone down if he did--

1021
00:37:10,360 --> 00:37:12,860
-But he said he would call
as soon as he was ready.

1022
00:37:13,360 --> 00:37:14,360
-I think something's wrong.

1023
00:37:14,360 --> 00:37:15,870
I want to go back
to the laboratory

1024
00:37:15,860 --> 00:37:17,360
and find out what's happened.

1025
00:37:17,360 --> 00:37:18,360
-All right, all right.

1026
00:37:18,370 --> 00:37:19,870
I want to know
what's happened too.

1027
00:37:19,870 --> 00:37:22,370
-Let's just swing by Lembach's
